Third-Party Dependencies
========================

This project uses the following third-party libraries and services:

1. boto3 (AWS SDK for Python)
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - URL: https://github.com/boto/boto3
   - Note: Provided by the AWS Lambda Python runtime; not bundled with this project.

2. botocore
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - URL: https://github.com/boto/botocore
   - Note: Provided by the AWS Lambda Python runtime; not bundled with this project.

3. TinyURL (URL shortening service)
   - URL: https://tinyurl.com
   - Usage: Shortens presigned S3 URLs for email delivery (prevents line-wrap breakage)
   - Data sent: Presigned S3 URL (temporary, 8-hour expiry)
   - Fallback: Full presigned URL used if service unavailable
   - Note: No authentication required. No customer data sent (only temporary S3 URL).
